- `croissant-and-coffee_redraw.svg`
- `croissant-and-coffee_redraw.png` (512 px)
- `croissant-and-coffee_redraw-48.png`

I didn't register the module, run the build or gallery updates, or touch `published/`. A new file, `published/gallery/container-centers.json`, appeared there during the session; it isn't mine and probably comes from a parallel session.

